---
/**
 * Landing — the front of the disposable camera.
 */
---

<section class="screen landing is-active" id="screen-landing" aria-labelledby="landing-title">
  <div class="corners" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>

  <div class="landing__hero">
    <!-- The pile of prints that drifts behind everything. Nothing here is
         interactive and nothing here is content — the pictures are drawn at
         build time by scripts/make-photos.mjs. -->
    <div class="fly" aria-hidden="true">
      <figure class="fly__slot" data-view="both" style="--x:52%;--y:11%;--w:206px;--r:-8deg;--d:.8">
        <img src="/photos/frame-01.jpg" alt="" width="400" height="261" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </figure>
      <figure class="fly__slot" data-view="mid" style="--x:67%;--y:7%;--w:176px;--r:6deg;--d:.5">
        <img src="/photos/frame-02.jpg" alt="" width="400" height="261" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </figure>
      <figure class="fly__slot fly__slot--strip" data-view="mid" style="--x:86%;--y:15%;--w:152px;--r:7deg;--d:1">
        <img src="/photos/strip-01.jpg" alt="" width="360" height="540" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </figure>
      <figure class="fly__slot" data-view="wide" style="--x:95%;--y:31%;--w:196px;--r:-5deg;--d:.7">
        <img src="/photos/frame-03.jpg" alt="" width="400" height="261" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </figure>
      <figure class="fly__slot" data-view="both" style="--x:58%;--y:26%;--w:168px;--r:9deg;--d:.45">
        <img src="/photos/frame-04.jpg" alt="" width="400" height="261" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </figure>
      <figure class="fly__slot" data-view="mid" style="--x:74%;--y:33%;--w:214px;--r:-9deg;--d:.9">
        <img src="/photos/frame-05.jpg" alt="" width="400" height="261" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </figure>
      <figure class="fly__slot" data-view="wide" style="--x:89%;--y:44%;--w:182px;--r:5deg;--d:.6">
        <img src="/photos/frame-06.jpg" alt="" width="400" height="261" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </figure>
      <figure class="fly__slot" data-view="both" style="--x:64%;--y:47%;--w:192px;--r:-6deg;--d:1.1">
        <img src="/photos/frame-07.jpg" alt="" width="400" height="261" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </figure>
      <figure class="fly__slot fly__slot--strip" data-view="mid" style="--x:96%;--y:57%;--w:146px;--r:-7deg;--d:.75">
        <img src="/photos/strip-02.jpg" alt="" width="360" height="540" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </figure>
      <figure class="fly__slot" data-view="wide" style="--x:79%;--y:56%;--w:174px;--r:8deg;--d:.5">
        <img src="/photos/frame-08.jpg" alt="" width="400" height="261" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </figure>
      <figure class="fly__slot" data-view="both" style="--x:71%;--y:68%;--w:212px;--r:-4deg;--d:.85">
        <img src="/photos/frame-09.jpg" alt="" width="400" height="261" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </figure>
      <figure class="fly__slot" data-view="wide" style="--x:93%;--y:73%;--w:188px;--r:6deg;--d:1">
        <img src="/photos/frame-10.jpg" alt="" width="400" height="261" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </figure>
      <figure class="fly__slot" data-view="mid" style="--x:60%;--y:82%;--w:180px;--r:-10deg;--d:.55">
        <img src="/photos/frame-11.jpg" alt="" width="400" height="261" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </figure>
      <figure class="fly__slot fly__slot--strip" data-view="wide" style="--x:78%;--y:90%;--w:150px;--r:9deg;--d:.95">
        <img src="/photos/strip-03.jpg" alt="" width="360" height="540" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </figure>
      <figure class="fly__slot" data-view="both" style="--x:94%;--y:88%;--w:170px;--r:-7deg;--d:.65">
        <img src="/photos/frame-12.jpg" alt="" width="400" height="261" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </figure>
    </div>

    <header class="landing__meta">
      <span>REMOTE · 2 PERSON · BOOTH</span>
      <span class="rec">REC</span>
    </header>

    <div class="landing__body">
      <p class="eyebrow">No. 002 — Two exposures, one print</p>

      <h1 class="landing__title" id="landing-title">
        <span>Photo</span>
        <span class="outline">Booth</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="landing__lede">Two cameras. <em>One little memory.</em></p>

      <div class="landing__actions">
        <a class="btn btn--solid" href="/create">Create a room</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/room">Join a room</a>
      </div>

      <div class="landing__resume" id="landing-resume" hidden>
        <span>Pick up where you left off —</span>
        <strong id="resume-code">····</strong>
        <button class="btn btn--solid" type="button" data-action="resume-room">Resume</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-sheet" aria-hidden="true">
      <span data-n="01"></span>
      <span data-n="02"></span>
      <span data-n="03"></span>
      <span data-n="04"></span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="howto" aria-labelledby="howto-title">
    <div class="howto__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Read before use — instruction leaflet</p>
      <h2 class="howto__title" id="howto-title">How to run the booth</h2>
      <p class="howto__lede">
        Six steps, about a minute. No account, nothing to install — just a code and two
        cameras.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ol class="howto__steps">
      <li class="howto__step">
        <span class="howto__n" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <div class="howto__text">
          <h3>Open a room</h3>
          <p>Press <em>Create a room</em> and you get a four-character code. The code is the booth.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="howto__step">
        <span class="howto__n" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <div class="howto__text">
          <h3>Send the code</h3>
          <p>Paste it to your partner or share the link. They walk in from their own phone or laptop.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="howto__step">
        <span class="howto__n" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
        <div class="howto__text">
          <h3>Allow the camera</h3>
          <p>Each of you says yes once. It is the only permission this ever asks for.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="howto__step">
        <span class="howto__n" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
        <div class="howto__text">
          <h3>Both press Ready</h3>
          <p>The countdown starts only when you are both ready — and a mission card tells you what to do with your face.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="howto__step">
        <span class="howto__n" aria-hidden="true">05</span>
        <div class="howto__text">
          <h3>Shoot four frames</h3>
          <p>Review each shot together: keep it, or both ask for a retake. Either of you can let it go.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="howto__step">
        <span class="howto__n" aria-hidden="true">06</span>
        <div class="howto__text">
          <h3>Take your strip</h3>
          <p>Download it, restyle it, start another roll, or head back to the room. Leave whenever — your partner keeps theirs.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <ul class="howto__notes">
      <li>Two phones, two laptops, or one of each</li>
      <li>Reload-safe — the code and the frames survive a refresh</li>
      <li>Nothing either of you presses moves the other</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <div class="filmstrip" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <footer class="landing__foot">
    <p class="privacy">Photos stay between you and your partner</p>
    <span class="stamp" id="landing-stamp">f/2.8 · ISO 400</span>
    <p class="colophon">© 2026 Lovebooth — all rights reserved</p>
  </footer>
</section>
